# Same-origin by default - do not set this to an absolute cross-origin URL (e.g.
# http://localhost:5100) for browser runtime code. The browser only ever calls relative /api/v1/...
# paths; Vite's dev proxy (see vite.config.ts) and nginx in production (see
# nginx/default.conf.template) both forward those to the real backend without exposing a
# cross-origin call to the browser. Leaving this unset/empty is the correct, intended default.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
